Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:43:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(cli): expose the package version through clap
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The container entrypoint rejects --version even though its MCP status and
HTTP health endpoints report the application version. Supply clap with
CARGO_PKG_VERSION so version inspection needs no database or MCP session.

This is the standalone upstream form of the earlier local version flag.
Exclude fork-only build.rs/+local metadata and startup/health rewrites.
The CLI change is independent of the preceding tableau diagnostics patch.

Copyright (c) 2026 佐々木隆志 (Takashi Sasaki) <takashi316@gmail.com> (https://x.com/TakashiSasaki)
---
 src/main.rs | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/main.rs b/src/main.rs
index 66cacaa..aac3fa7 100644
--- a/src/main.rs
+++ b/src/main.rs
@@ -185,6 +185,7 @@ const DEFAULT_DATA_DIR: &str = "~/.open-ontologies";
 #[derive(Parser)]
 #[command(
     name = "open-ontologies",
+    version = env!("CARGO_PKG_VERSION"),
     about = "Terraform for Knowledge Graphs — AI-native ontology engine"
 )]
 struct Cli {
